As a major oversight on my part, credit was not given to the original
authors of "Adventure", Will Crowther and Don Woods, in the posting of
550 point Adventure (based on their game). I would like to apologize to
them for not adding them in the history file and to the credit portion
of the "NEWSDATA" entry in text.d.  The game would never have existed
without them, nor would the 550 point version be complete without
giving them credit.

